[00:10.50]1. Your glory, God, your mighty works abound,
[00:20.74]In skies above, their praise for you resounds.
[00:31.72]Creation speaks without a voice or word;
[00:39.68]In all the earth, its message can be heard.
[00:49.62]Creation speaks without a voice or word;
[00:59.26]In all the earth, its message can be heard.
[01:08.90]2. True wisdom starts with wholesome fear of you
[01:18.76]And guards our way in all we say and do.
[01:29.50]Your wise commands enlighten young and old—
[01:39.04]A treasure far exceeding finest gold.
[01:48.32]Your wise commands enlighten young and old—
[01:59.00]A treasure far exceeding finest gold.
[02:23.30]3. By knowing you, our life is not in vain,
[02:32.96]And by your word, our life will be sustained.
[02:43.02]The greatest honor anyone can gain
[02:52.10]Will come to all who sanctify your name.
[03:02.16]The greatest honor anyone can gain
[03:09.00]Will come to all who sanctify your name.
